   "text": "Compromise sign: manager rejected stating she didn't make this request.\n\nI'm sorry, but I can't do a password reset or send a reset link from this conversation.\n\nReset links can only go to the contact details on file with HR. The Gmail address you gave isn't on file, so I couldn't send a link there in any case. Because you're writing from the guest kiosk, I also had to confirm your identity before doing anything. I tried to do that through a manager check, but the manager didn't confirm the request.\n\nBecause of that, I've passed this to Security under reference SEC-500. I've made no changes to the account, and ticket T-6008 is marked as escalated. If you are Renata, Security on-call will contact you within about an hour through the contact details on file, and they can help you get back in."
  },
