   "text": "I know this is frustrating, especially right before a client call. Security will only use the contact details already on file with HR, so I can't add another number or email for them to reach you. Once your phone is charged, you can reply to their contact. You can also come back to the desk through a signed-in device and mention reference SEC-500. Good luck with your call."
